{{JPExclusive}}
'''Catnip Dragon''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]] during the [[JRA Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]]. Like [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]] and [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]], it is capped at level 1, meaning it can only be upgraded using +levels.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 628
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Catnip Dragon
|name2 = Famous Catnip Dragon
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Famous Catnip Dragon''' at level 1+9.

==Strategy/Usage==
Use Catnip Dragon like you would use [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]]. Their stats are inferior to even a level 20+2 Dragon Cat, which only gets worse once Dragon's [[True Form]] is unlocked, but their Massive Damage ability makes it stronger than anything short of a level 20+88 King Dragon against Dark enemies. Unfortunately, the lack of Area Attack does not combine too well with the rush-down nature of most Dark enemies, reducing Catnip Dragon to a support unit in almost all stages which feature said trait. As a result, they should only be used if their level is disproportionately high compared to that of their variants, resulting in superior stats.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner}}

